OL,3,CThree football fans banned from
OL,4,Cmatches after cup final disorder
OL,6,FThree people from Guernsey have been
OL,7,Fbanned from attending football matches
OL,8,Forganised by Jersey and Guernsey's
OL,9,FFootball Associations for fighting and
OL,10,Fsetting off flares during the men's
OL,11,FMuratti Vase Final.
OL,13,FOfficials say they were "appalled at
OL,14,Fthe disgraceful behaviour of a small
OL,15,Fminority" of fans during the game at
OL,16,FSt Helier's Springfield Stadium on
OL,17,FSaturday 16 May.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/6
