PN,35602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F356A1785334700
OL,3,CThree football fans banned from
OL,4,Cmatches after cup final disorder
OL,6,FAn investigation by the States of
OL,7,FJersey Police, working with both FAs
OL,8,Fand Guernsey Police, has been
OL,9,Fcompleted, leading to the
OL,10,Fidentification of these three people
OL,11,Fwho are all assisting the force with
OL,12,Fits enquiries.
OL,14,FJersey Police says it is not looking
OL,15,Ffor anyone else in connection with the
OL,16,Fincident, with the banning orders
OL,17,Fissued by the two islands' respective
OL,18,Ffootball governing bodies.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,357,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F356A1785334700
OL,3,CThree football fans banned from
OL,4,Cmatches after cup final disorder
OL,6,FNo one has been charged with any
OL,7,Foffence, although the police have not
OL,8,Fruled out future criminal proceedings.
OL,10,FThe force says the behaviour,
OL,11,Fincluding entering the field of play,
OL,12,Fthrowing objects and engaging in
OL,13,Fthreatening or abusive conduct, "has
OL,14,Fno place in football or the wider
OL,15,Fcommunity and will not be tolerated".
OL,17,FIn a statement, Tim Pryor, CEO of the
OL,18,FJersey FA, says: "This sends out a
OL,19,Fclear and strong message that this
OL,20,Fkind of behaviour will not be
OL,21,Ftolerated at local football matches.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,357,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F356A1785334700
OL,3,CThree football fans banned from
OL,4,Cmatches after cup final disorder
OL,6,F"The huge majority of the 1,500 people
OL,7,Fin attendance at the men's Muratti
OL,8,FVase final behaved well, enjoyed the
OL,9,Foccasion and supported their team in
OL,10,Fthe right way.
OL,12,F"A small minority crossed the line,
OL,13,Fand they will not be welcome back at
OL,14,FSpringfield for future Jersey FA
OL,15,Frepresentative team matches."
OL,17,FGary Roberts, the Guernsey FA's Chief
OL,18,FExecutive, adds: "The behaviour
OL,19,Fwitnessed that day has no place at
OL,20,Fthese matches.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,357,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F356A1785334700
OL,3,CThree football fans banned from
OL,4,Cmatches after cup final disorder
OL,6,F"This announcement makes it abundantly
OL,7,Fclear that behaviour of this nature
OL,8,Fwill not be tolerated and has defined
OL,9,Fconsequences.
OL,11,F"Those identified as being involved in
OL,12,Fthe incidents at the Muratti Final
OL,13,Fwill not be able to attend future
OL,14,FGuernsey FA Representative matches at
OL,15,FVictoria Park, which is a strong
OL,16,Fmessage we hope will be appreciated by
OL,17,Fgenuine football spectators and the
OL,18,Fwider community."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/6
